        "TileImage": "$($repository ebad48b0-50bb-443a-ab07-96d8c9d56b51).Image",
        "Description": "Nov. 30, 2006.\r\rCiao, 47. Today the main enemies is the targets. I discovered the leader&apos;s name, the leader who ordered the hits; Francesco Carmine Capone. And his four lieutenants; Edoardo Macchione, Henry Padovano, William Barosselli &amp; Carlo Pandolfi. And Pandolfi, he went back to the island to apologize to Frank Capone for ratting him out, but we both know that Capone wants him dead. So kill them as usual &amp; when you are done I&apos;ll pay you $80M. Grazie per il vostro aiuto in tutto questo. Addio",
